   "text": "reads the question, picks a playbook, calls tools, writes the answer\n9 playbooks: well status, downtime, spills, root cause, SOP audit,\n   conflicts, memory, feedback, which chart to use\nbackup models: local model first -> free cloud models if it fails\nbest so far: Nemotron 120B",
