   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "X-ray panel (in the chat app), per answer:\n  - every tool it called + the inputs\n  - which playbooks it loaded\n  - pass/fail of the 6 checks, each retry\n  - tokens used\nOpik dashboard: every test run, score per case\ncrash-safe: half-finished runs are still saved",
   "originalText": "X-ray panel (in the chat app), per answer:\n  - every tool it called + the inputs\n  - which playbooks it loaded\n  - pass/fail of the 6 checks, each retry\n  - tokens used\nOpik dashboard: every test run, score per case\ncrash-safe: half-finished runs are still saved",
   "fontSize": 16,
